    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my legs have been cramping a ton lately and i just feel super tired all the time. i think my potassium might be low... i have stage 3 kidney disease so i have to be careful but do u think it's safe if i start taking those 99mg potassium pills like 3 or 4 times a day to help with the cramps?",
