      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but my doctor is super hard to reach and usually just tells me to wait for my next appointment which is weeks away. the cramps are making it hard to sleep and i'm worried i'm already low. if i just take one pill a day instead of 4, is that basically fine? i just want some relief until i can actually talk to him.",
