    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "urgent care is so expensive and i really dont want to deal with the hassle if it's just a minor thing. honestly i read online that most people with ckd actually need more potassium to keep things balanced. if i just took a little extra every morning with breakfast it wouldn't be that much, right? it's just a tiny dose compared to what people normally take.",
